re next to each other on the color wheel. They are perceived as calm and serene.\n\nImage: Analogous color scheme\n\n#323513\n\nColor has no name\n\n#332512\n\nColor has no name\n\n#351513\n\nColor has no name\n\n### Triadic\n\nTriadic color schemes are created by picking three colors equally spaced on the color wheel. They appear quite contrasted and multicolored.\n\nImage: Triadic color scheme\n\n#332512\n\nColor has no name\n\n#133527\n\nColor has no name\n\n#271335\n\nColor has no name\n\n### Tetradic\n\nTetradic color schemes are made form two couples of complementary colors in a rectangular shape on the color wheel.\n\nImage: Tetradic color scheme\n\n#332512\n\nColor has no name\n\n#213513\n\nColor has no name\n\n#132135\n\nColor has no name\n\n#271335\n\nColor has no name\n\n### Square\n\nSquare color schemes are like tetradic arranged in a square instead of rectangle. Colors appear even more contrasting.\n\nImage: Square color scheme\n\n#332512\n\nColor has no name\n\n#133515\n\nColor has no name\n\n#132135\n\nColor has no name\n\n#351332\n\nColor has no name\n\n## Alternatives to #332512 color\n\nView adjacent and very similar colors.\n\n## Nearest named colors to #332512\n\nThe closest officially registered color names in the Register, ordered by similarity — your shade’s neighborhood is already being claimed.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#332512 - code orange foncé légèrement grisé - RGB (51,37,18) (https://htmlcouleur.com/332512)\nciteturn6search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; # La couleur hexadécimale #332512\n\n#132135\n\n### COULEURS MONOCHROMATIQUES\n\nDes nuances de #332512, du foncé au clair, une autre vision de la palette.\n\n#0d0905\n\n#1a1309\n\n#261c0e\n\n#332512\n\n#665c4d\n\n#999289\n\n#ccc9c4\n\n## ANALYSE, DÉCOMPOSITION ET AUTRES OPTIONS DE COULEUR\n\n### synthèse additive\n\nLes composants RVB de #332512 sont les 3 couleurs (rouge, vert, bleu) prises séparément, les 2 autres qu